notes:
•  FIX: scrubbing the timeline. The timeline showed a whole hour, so a short recording was only a few pixels wide and the slightest drag ran off it into empty time (black picture). Now:
     - opening recordings zooms the timeline to fit them (a clip fills the timeline; a recording folder shows its last 10 minutes);
     - new - / + / Fit zoom buttons on the playback bar, and finer zoom steps down to 15 seconds across;
     - dragging past the end of a recording holds its last picture instead of going black;
     - you can drag anywhere on the timeline, including the time labels (slide the timeline with right-drag or Shift+drag).
